ry as the Community Change grant. “It gave real money to disinvested communities like mine, funding to clean up and to revita"}], "policy_stages": [], "track": "action", "country_mentions": [], "annotation_method": "dictionary-evidence-v1", "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "archive_source_endpoint": "https://insideclimatenews.org/wp-json/wp/v2/posts", "archive_collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:49:19.385494+00:00", "published_at_raw": "2025-12-27T10:00:00", "sample_frame": "public_archives_20261102", "sampling_method": "deterministic_uniform_url_hash", "sampling_probability": 0.30234709214938144, "country_evidence": [], "country_tag_version": "country-span-v2", "quarantine_reason": "stored_excerpt_and_headline_do_not_establish_climate_scope", "quarantined_at": "2026-11-02T02:09:04.573678+00:00"}
{"text_id": "text_017da776a94f425dcbd5", "record_id": "article_017da776a94f425d", "canonical_url": "https://news.mongabay.com/2025/12/sri-lanka-looks-to-build-disaster-resilient-housing-after-devastating-cyclone", "publisher_url": "https://news.mongabay.com/2025/12/sri-lanka-looks-to-build-disaster-resilient-housing-after-devastating-cyclone", "title_original": "Sri Lanka looks to build disaster-resilient housing after devastating cyclone", "title_zh": null, "title_en": null, "summary_zh": null, "summary_en": null, "source_name": "Mongabay", "source_id": "INT007", "source_type": "professional_climate_media", "language": "en", "published_at": "2025-12-27T04:41:49+00:00", "source_text": "ARANAYAKA, Sri Lanka — Bandara Jayaratne from Beraliya, a village in the Aranayaka region in Sri Lanka, is among the fortunate individuals who escaped a landslide on Nov. 28 that occurred right behind his house. Landslides aren’t a new phenomenon in this part of the country. In 2016, at least a 100 people died when […]", "text_kind": "source_excerpt", "text_characters": 320, "text_sha256": "780bfdc1d3d78f3668e2bbb0aa7c67376a623dac4d4dffbd4d5f1f34c17a3b7a", "text_basis": "public_wordpress_excerpt", "collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:49:45.311278+00:00", "extractor_version": "1.0.0", "document_type": "source_report", "document_type_basis": "document_genre_not_independently_established", "event_date": null, "event_date_precision": null, "source_updated_at": null, "policy_direction": null, "legal_effect": null, "summary_model": null, "quantitative_claims": [], "conference_ids": [], "agenda_item_id": null, "thematic_day_id": null, "rights_status": "source_attributed_excerpt_not_full_text", "country_codes": [{"alpha2": "LK", "alpha3": "LKA", "name_zh": "斯里兰卡", "name_en": "Sri Lanka"}], "governance_themes": [], "policy_tools": [], "policy_stages": [], "track": "action", "country_mentions": [{"alpha2": "LK", "alpha3": "LKA", "name_zh": "斯里兰卡", "name_en": "Sri Lanka"}], "annotation_method": "dicti