{"text_id": "text_f498ffa7afae76542dfa", "record_id": "article_f498ffa7afae7654", "canonical_url": "https://news.mongabay.com/2025/10/global-conservation-body-takes-first-step-to-protect-oceans-twilight-zone", "publisher_url": "https://news.mongabay.com/2025/10/global-conservation-body-takes-first-step-to-protect-oceans-twilight-zone", "title_original": "Global conservation body takes first step to protect ocean’s twilight zone", "title_zh": null, "title_en": null, "summary_zh": null, "summary_en": null, "source_name": "Mongabay", "source_id": "INT007", "source_type": "professional_climate_media", "language": "en", "published_at": "2025-10-23T09:30:02+00:00", "source_text": "The mesopelagic zone is the chilly, dimly lit layer of ocean found 200-1,000 meters (660-3,300 feet) below the surface, which scientists say plays key roles in the marine food web and carbon cycle. On Oct. 15, delegates to the IUCN World Conservation Congress in Abu Dhabi adopted a motion to protect it. The motion calls […]", "text_kind": "source_excerpt", "text_characters": 325, "text_sha256": "1ee06f7e26f6e7b19e22fd61bedb3ac8ee4966170a40277eff9369432ac304f6", "text_basis": "public_wordpress_excerpt", "collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:50:40.674663+00:00", "extractor_version": "1.0.0", "document_type": "source_report", "document_type_basis": "document_genre_not_independently_established", "event_date": null, "event_date_precision": null, "source_updated_at": null, "policy_direction": null, "legal_effect": null, "summary_model": null, "quantitative_claims": [], "conference_ids": [], "agenda_item_id": null, "thematic_day_id": null, "rights_status": "source_attributed_excerpt_not_full_text", "country_codes": [], "governance_themes": [], "policy_tools": [], "policy_stages": [{"id": "adopted", "label_zh": "通过", "label_en": "Adopted", "start": 273, "end": 280, "evidence": " carbon cycle. On Oct. 15, delegates to the IUCN World Conservation Congress in Abu Dhabi adopted a motion to protect it. The motion calls […]"}], "track": "action", "country_mentions": [], "annotation_method": "dictionary-evidence-v1", "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "archive_source_endpoint": "https://news.mongabay.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts", "archive_collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:50:40.706179+00:00", "published_at_raw": "2025-10-23T09:30:02", "sample_frame": "public_archives_20261102", "sampling_method": "deterministic_uniform_url_hash", "sampling_probability": 0.30234709214938144, "country_evidence": [], "country_tag_version": "country-span-v2", "quarantine_reason": "stored_excerpt_and_headline_do_not_establish_climate_scope", "quarantined_at": "2026-11-02T02:09:04.573678+00:00"}
{"text_id": "text_a06083ec00aae8d336d5", "record_id": "article_a06083ec00aae8d3", "canonical_url": "https://insideclimatenews.org/news/22102025/peru-amazon-stingless-bees-rights", "publisher_url": "https://insideclimatenews.org/news/22102025/peru-amazon-stingless-bees-rights", "title_original": "Defending Stingless Bees in the Peruvian Amazon", "title_zh": null, "title_en": null, "summary_zh": null, "summary_en": null, "source_name": "Inside Climate News", "source_id": "INT004", "source_type": "professional_climate_media", "language": "en", "published_at": "2025-10-22T09:00:00+00:00", "source_text": "SATIPO, Peru—Dry leaves rustled beneath the hem of her terracotta-tinted dress as Micaela Huaman Fernandez knelt on the forest floor. Leaning in toward the base of a moss-covered palo santo tree, she pointed to a flicker of tiny golden insects fluttering in and out of view. “Shinkenka,” she murmured softly, watching them vanish through a […]", "text_kind": "source_excerpt", "text_characters": 343, "text_sha256": "f0fdea9e2889e92d10f5f0a5169cd59ae0e577585466d4a8e047702a091b5494", "text_basis": "public_wordpress_excerpt", "collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:50:02.781932+00:00", "extractor_version": "1.0.0", "document_type": "source_report", "document_type_basis": "document_genre_not_independently_established", "event_date": null, "event_date_precision": null, "source_updated_at": null, "policy_direction": null, "legal_effect": null, "summary_model": null, "quantitative_claims": [], "conference_ids": [], "agenda_item_id": null, "thematic_day_id": null, "rights_status": "source_attributed_excerpt_not_full_text", "country_codes": [{"alpha2": "PE", "alpha3": "PER", "name_zh": "秘鲁", "name_en": "Peru"}], "governance_themes": [], "policy_tools": [], "policy_stages": [], "track": "action", "country_mentions": [{"alpha2": "PE", "alpha3": "PER", "name_zh": "秘鲁", "name_en": "Peru"}], "annotation_method": "dictionary-evidence-v1", "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "