{"text_id": "text_1b90d04771f425c07125", "record_id": "article_1b90d04771f425c0", "canonical_url": "https://insideclimatenews.org/news/05062025/inside-clean-energy-inflation-reduction-act-politics-2", "publisher_url": "https://insideclimatenews.org/news/05062025/inside-clean-energy-inflation-reduction-act-politics-2", "title_original": "What Does the ‘Big Beautiful’ Debate Tell Us About the Politics of the IRA?", "title_zh": null, "title_en": null, "summary_zh": null, "summary_en": null, "source_name": "Inside Climate News", "source_id": "INT004", "source_type": "professional_climate_media", "language": "en", "published_at": "2025-06-05T13:00:00+00:00", "source_text": "One of the largest manufacturing investments in Ohio’s history has transformed cornfields in a rural county into a battery factory that could soon have thousands of employees. The plant, a joint venture of Honda and LG Energy Solution, is part of a wave of new factories developed across the country following the passage of the […]", "text_kind": "source_excerpt", "text_characters": 332, "text_sha256": "fc4a192bd272b3bc0b4bedfb8d818340135084e811667579aa31d151a2501dbb", "text_basis": "public_wordpress_excerpt", "collected_at": "2026-11-02T01:51:42.913454+00:00", "extractor_version": "1.0.0", "document_type": "source_report", "document_type_basis": "document_genre_not_independently_established", "event_date": null, "event_date_precision": null, "source_updated_at": null, "policy_direction": null, "legal_effect": null, "summary_model": null, "quantitative_claims": [], "conference_ids": [], "agenda_item_id": null, "thematic_day_id": null, "rights_status": "source_attributed_excerpt_not_full_text", "country_codes": [], "governance_themes": [{"id": "energy", "label_zh": "能源与产业", "label_en": "Energy and industry", "start": 219, "end": 225, "evidence": "y that could soon have thousands of employees. The plant, a joint venture of Honda and LG Energy Solution, is part of a wave of new factories developed across 